OL,3,GNEWSANearly 40,000 sign petitions
OL,4,Aagainst city expansion
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative MPs have collected nearly
OL,7,F40,000 signatures on petitions opposing
OL,8,Fplans to expand Leicester's political
OL,9,Fboundary.
OL,11,FThe government has announced a major
OL,12,Fredrawing of local authority
OL,13,Fboundaries, which will see the city
OL,14,Fextended into areas currently served by
OL,15,Fneighbouring councils from 2028.
OL,17,FLeicestershire Tory MPs Alberto Costa,
OL,18,FNeil O'Brien, Peter Bedford and Alicia
OL,19,FKearns said they planned to hand their
OL,20,Fpetitions in at 10 Downing Street on 14
OL,21,FSeptember.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
